<title>SINGAPORE: Electronic Resources tops actives list.</title>
<headline>Electronic Resources tops actives list.</headline>
<dateline>SINGAPORE 1996-09-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Electronic Resources Ltd topped the actives list in Singapore's mid-morning trade on Thursday with several block trades totalling 10.2 million shares crossed at Singapore $1.40 each, dealers said.  </p>
<p>At 0240 GMT, the shares were trading at S$1.43 after hitting a high of S$1.51. Total volume was 10.4 million units.</p>
<p>Dealers said they were not aware of any reason for the volume.</p>
<p>The company recently announced a 31 percent increase in first half profit to S$4.52 million.</p>
<p>- Singapore Newsroom 65-8703080</p>
